# AI credentials for process / revalidate / triage.
# scan is free (regex only) and needs no credentials.

# --- Recommended: direct OpenAI API (Codex agent, gpt-5.5) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# --- Or: Vercel AI Gateway (covers Codex + Claude + Pi) ---
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=vck_...

# --- Or: Anthropic directly (use --agent claude) ---
# ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# --- Or: reuse a logged-in claude/codex CLI on this machine (no vars needed) ---

# Note: deepsec does not integrate with Cursor's Cloud Agent API.
# Use codex + gpt-5.5 above for the same model via OpenAI (or gateway).
